<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kyong Dong City Gas IPO begins trade.</title>
<headline>Kyong Dong City Gas IPO begins trade.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kyong Dong City Gas Co Ltd began trading for the first time at a base price of 40,000 won per share on Friday, the Korea Stock Exchange said.  </p>
<p>The base price is the weighted average of bids and offers received by the exchange and sets the trading range for the first day.</p>
<p>During its January 20-21 initial public offering, the subscription price for Kyong Dong's 720,000 shares had been set at 29,000 won.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
